  "id": "p2-component",
  "term": "P2 component",
  "definition": "The P2 component is a positive event-related brain potential measured in ERP recordings. In this source, it is used as an index of how difficult lexical access is during language production, with a larger P2 linked to harder word retrieval in picture naming.",
